@page
@model RecruitCatZafrazy.Pages.OurTeamModel

<section class="page-section">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading text-center">

            <h1 class="section-title">
                Our Team
            </h1>

            <p>
                Meet the people behind NexaBridge Consulting.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="row g-4">

            <!-- ZARAH -->

            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">

                <div class="team-card">

                    <img src="~/images/zarah-zafra.png"
                         class="team-image"
                         alt="Zarah Zafra">

                    <div class="team-content">

                        <h2 class="team-name">
                            Zarah Zafra
                        </h2>

                        <div class="team-role">
                            Candidate Experience & Operations Lead
                        </div>

                        <p>
                            Zarah manages candidate coordination and recruitment operations at NexaBridge Consulting.
                            She focuses on keeping the recruitment process organized, ensuring applications are properly
                            tracked, and maintaining clear communication between candidates, recruiters, and clients.
                            <br><br>

                            She also supports improvements to internal recruitment processes and systems, helping the team
                            provide candidates with a consistent and efficient experience.
                            <br><br>

                            <strong>Specialties:</strong>
                            Recruitment operations, candidate coordination, process improvement, and client support.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- BETH -->

            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">

                <div class="team-card">

                    <img src="~/images/beth-dwin.png"
                         class="team-image"
                         alt="Beth Dwin">

                    <div class="team-content">

                        <h2 class="team-name">
                            Beth Dwin
                        </h2>

                        <div class="team-role">
                            Managing Director & Senior Recruitment Consultant
                        </div>

                        <p>
                            Beth leads NexaBridge Consulting and works closely with employers to understand their workforce
                            requirements. She has more than ten years of recruitment experience across professional services,
                            aviation, logistics, and technology.
                            <br><br>

                            Her approach focuses on building long-term client relationships and identifying candidates whose
                            skills and experience align with both the position and the organization.
                            <br><br>

                            <strong>Specialties:</strong>
                            Client management, executive recruitment, workforce planning, and permanent placements.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- LOUIS -->

            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">

                <div class="team-card">

                    <img src="~/images/louis-omar.png"
                         class="team-image"
                         alt="Louis Omar">

                    <div class="team-content">

                        <h2 class="team-name">
                            Louis Omar
                        </h2>

                        <div class="team-role">
                            Recruitment Consultant
                        </div>

                        <p>
                            Louis manages candidate sourcing and screening across technical, logistics, and corporate roles.
                            He works with applicants from the initial application stage through interviews and placement.
                            <br><br>

                            He focuses on understanding both the technical requirements of each vacancy and the candidate's
                            longer-term career interests before recommending them to employers.
                            <br><br>

                            <strong>Specialties:</strong>
                            Candidate sourcing, resume screening, interviews, and technical recruitment.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>